        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-900">7. Indemnification</h2>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">To the fullest extent permitted by law, you agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless BreederHQ LLC, its officers, directors, employees, agents, and affiliates (the "BreederHQ Parties") from and against any and all claims, demands, actions, damages, losses, liabilities, fines, penalties, costs, and expenses (including reasonable attorneys' fees), including those brought or asserted by a Buyer, another User, or a government authority, arising from or related to:</p>
        <ul class="mb-4 ml-6 list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700"><li>Your listings, storefront, Provider Content, animals, or breeding services;</li><li>The health, genetics, temperament, behavior, condition, or care of any animal you sell, place, offer, breed, house, transport, or deliver, including any injury, illness, death, or property damage it causes or suffers;</li><li>Any agreement between you and a Buyer, including its price, deposit, reservation-fee, refund, cancellation, health-guarantee, warranty, delivery, and return terms, and any Transaction Contract you create, customize, import, adopt, or send, including template or AI-generated language you adopt;</li><li>Any meeting, visit, pickup, delivery, or other in-person contact between you, or anyone acting for you, and a Buyer or another User;</li><li>Any dispute between you and a Buyer or another User;</li><li>Any transaction between you and a Buyer;</li><li>Your breach of this Agreement;</li><li>Your violation of any applicable law or regulation;</li><li>Any claim by a Buyer or third party related to the health, condition, or quality of an animal you sold or breeding service you provided;</li><li>Any misrepresentation or fraud in your listings or communications;</li><li>Any injury, illness, death, or property damage caused by an animal you sold;</li><li>Any chargebacks, payment reversals, disputes, or negative balances arising from your transactions, including those debited from BreederHQ's platform payment account on your behalf;</li><li>Any false attestation by you under §3.3 of the Terms of Service, or the inauthenticity, alteration, expiration, revocation, or misrepresentation of any document you upload in connection with a Credential Attestation;</li><li>Taxes, licenses, permits, and registrations that applicable law assigns to you.</li></ul>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>Claims alleging BreederHQ's negligence.</strong> Your obligation under this Section applies even if the claim alleges that a BreederHQ Party was negligent, to the fullest extent applicable law permits a party to be indemnified for its own negligence. It does not apply to the extent a loss is finally determined to have been caused by a BreederHQ Party's fraud, gross negligence, or willful misconduct.</p>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>Defense and settlement.</strong> BreederHQ will notify you of a claim for which it seeks indemnification, but a delay in notice relieves you of your obligation only to the extent the delay materially prejudices you. BreederHQ may choose to control the defense of the claim with counsel of its choice, in which case you will pay the reasonable costs of that defense and cooperate as BreederHQ reasonably requests; otherwise you will defend the claim with counsel reasonably acceptable to BreederHQ. You may not settle any claim in a way that admits fault on behalf of, or imposes any obligation or restriction on, a BreederHQ Party without BreederHQ's prior written consent.</p>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>Relationship to other terms.</strong> This Section is in addition to §5 of the Terms of Service and §4.5 of this Agreement. If you are a Consumer, as defined in §10.2(d) of the Terms of Service, §10.5 of the Terms of Service applies to this Section; if you are a Consumer who lives in New Jersey, this Section does not apply to you, and any obligation you have to indemnify BreederHQ is determined under applicable New Jersey law. This Section survives the termination of this Agreement and of your Marketplace access.</p>
