        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>(d) Fallback.</strong> If any part of this Section is held unenforceable as to a particular claim or person, that part is limited to the minimum extent necessary to make it enforceable, or severed if it cannot be limited, as to that claim or person, and the rest of this Section continues in full force and effect.</p>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>(e) Same release in other User Agreements.</strong> §4.4 of the Terms of Service, §7.5 of the Marketplace Transaction Terms, and §7A of the Service Provider Agreement contain the same release. They are one release, stated in each document so that it reaches every User the document governs; none of them enlarges or narrows the others. "The BreederHQ Parties" in this Section are the same persons released in each of those provisions, and "a Buyer or any other User" has the same meaning as "another User" in them.</p>
        <hr class="my-8 border-gray-200" />
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-900">8. Profile Indicators and Reviews</h2>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">8.1 Profile Indicators</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">BreederHQ may display Profile Indicators on a Provider's profile or listings reflecting facts about the Provider's account history or representations, including without limitation date of account creation, date of last login, frequency of response to Buyer inquiries, count of completed transactions, count of unresolved disputes, Third-Party Identity Verification Passthrough status under §2.6 of the Terms of Service, and Third-Party Registry Passthrough status under §2.5 of the Terms of Service. <strong>Profile Indicators reflect data; they do not reflect BreederHQ's editorial evaluation, endorsement, ranking, or warranty of the Provider.</strong> <strong>BreederHQ shall not label any Profile Indicator, alone or combined with other indicators, with "verified," "vetted," "trusted," "approved," "certified," "endorsed," or similar language characterizing the Provider.</strong> A Third-Party Identity Verification Passthrough shows only that, as of the date shown, the Third-Party Identity Verification Provider reported that the individual who completed the Identity Check for the account passed it, as described in §2.6 of the Terms of Service. BreederHQ may begin, modify, or cease displaying any Profile Indicator at any time. The Provider has no contractual right to the display, modification, or continuation of any Profile Indicator. Where the underlying fact reflected by an indicator changes (for example, a Provider's response time slows materially, or a previously-passed Third-Party Registry Passthrough record is no longer returned), BreederHQ may cease display of the indicator without notice. The Identity Check requirement in §2.3 applies whether or not a Third-Party Identity Verification Passthrough is displayed, and displaying, modifying, or ceasing to display that indicator does not by itself change whether the requirement is met.</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">8.2 Reviews and Testimonials</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Buyers may post reviews, ratings, or testimonials regarding their experience with a Provider. Provider agrees not to:</p>
        <ul class="mb-4 ml-6 list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700"><li>offer any incentive, discount, refund, or other consideration in exchange for a positive review;</li><li>threaten, intimidate, retaliate against, or pressure any Buyer regarding a review;</li><li>submit, cause to be submitted, or solicit fake, misleading, or fabricated reviews of the Provider's own listings or of any competitor;</li><li>aggregate, mirror, or republish reviews outside the Services in a manner that misrepresents the review's source or scope.</li></ul>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Provider acknowledges that BreederHQ does not investigate or evaluate the accuracy of any individual Buyer review. Buyer reviews are user-generated content, and BreederHQ reserves every protection available to it under applicable law with respect to such content, which may include protections under 47 U.S.C. §230.</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">8.3 Credential Display Discipline</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Where a Provider has attested to a professional credential under §3.3 of the Terms of Service and uploaded a Supporting Document under §4.4 of the Acceptable Use Policy, BreederHQ may display the attestation (with any of the following: the credential name, the issuing body's name, the credential identifier the Provider supplied, and a link to the uploaded document) on the Provider's profile or listings. The Provider authorizes such display and represents that the credential information and uploaded document are accurate and authentic. <strong>BreederHQ shall not append to such display any badge, descriptor, label, characterization, tooltip wrapping, or other language characterizing the credential or document as "verified," "vetted," "approved," "authentic," "current," or similar, except to render an unmodified Third-Party Registry Passthrough indicator under §2.5 of the Terms of Service.</strong> Where the Provider withdraws the attestation, the credential lapses, or the underlying document is the subject of a Credential Dispute under §8.4 of the Acceptable Use Policy, BreederHQ may suspend or cease display.</p>
